From: =?UTF-8?q?J=C3=A1nos=20Mik=C3=B3?=
 <693558+janosmiko@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 11 Aug 2026 11:37:58 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 063/154] build: move atrium_settings_menu_hook.mm into the
 is_mac arm
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

It imported <Cocoa/Cocoa.h> and its header already lived in is_mac, but the
.mm landed in the portable arm by mistake. A Linux gn gen would
have handed an Objective-C++ file to a non-Mac toolchain.

Signed-off-by: János Mikó <693558+janosmiko@users.noreply.github.com>
---
 chrome/browser/ui/BUILD.gn | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/chrome/browser/ui/BUILD.gn b/chrome/browser/ui/BUILD.gn
index f3f0dcdfa5fc8..cbd2099a13b9a 100644
--- a/chrome/browser/ui/BUILD.gn
+++ b/chrome/browser/ui/BUILD.gn
@@ -3502,7 +3502,6 @@ static_library("ui") {
       "atrium/atrium_peek_navigation_throttle.cc",
       "atrium/atrium_settings_window.cc",
       "atrium/atrium_settings_source.cc",
-      "atrium/atrium_settings_menu_hook.mm",
       "atrium/atrium_profile_bootstrap.h",
       "atrium/atrium_profile_bootstrap.cc",
       "atrium/atrium_status_bubble_hook.h",
@@ -3542,6 +3541,7 @@ static_library("ui") {
       "atrium/atrium_settings_window.h",
       "atrium/atrium_settings_source.h",
       "atrium/atrium_settings_menu_hook.h",
+      "atrium/atrium_settings_menu_hook.mm",
       "atrium/atrium_peek_widget.h",
       "atrium/atrium_peek_widget.mm",
       "atrium/atrium_sidebar_overlay_widget.h",
